uditoría.", "enumOptions": null, "defaultValue": null, "relationTarget": null}, {"name": "clave", "type": "TEXT", "label": "Clave", "unique": true, "indexed": false, "visible": true, "editable": true, "position": 21, "required": true, "timeZone": null, "attributes": {"srid": null, "dimension": null, "geometry_type": null, "file_max_bytes": null, "file_content_types": null}, "description": "predio|servicio|anio|periodo|secuencia|version: una sola cuota por predio, servicio, año, mes y secuencia de uso (det_arbitrio_uq de rentas, un PU por uso). La versión sube con cada anulación. Las cuotas anteriores a la secuencia tienen predio|servicio|anio|periodo|version.", "enumOptions": null, "defaultValue": null, "relationTarget": null}, {"name": "predio", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Predio", "unique": false, "indexed": false, "visible": true, "editable": true, "position": 22, "required": true, "timeZone": null, "attributes": {"srid": null, "dimension": null, "geometry_type": null, "file_max_bytes": null, "file_content_types": null}, "description": null, "enumOptions": null, "defaultValue": null, "relationTarget": "predio"}, {"name": "contribuyente", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Contribuyente", "unique": false, "indexed": false, "visible": true, "editable": true, "position": 23, "required": true, "timeZone": null, "attributes": {"srid": null, "dimension": null, "geometry_type": null, "file_max_bytes": null, "file_content_types": null}, "description": null, "enumOptions": null, "defaultValue": null, "relationTarget": "contribuyente"}, {"name": "servicio", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Servicio", "unique": false, "indexed": false, "visible": true, "editable": true, "position": 24, "required": true, "timeZone": null, "attributes": {"srid": null, "dimension": null, "geometry_type": null, "file_max_bytes": null, "file_content_types": null}, "description": null, "enumOptions": null, "defaultValue": null, "relationTarget": "servicio_arbitrio"}, {"name": "parametro", "type": "RELATION", "label": "Parámetro aplicado", "unique": false, "indexed": false, "visible": true, "editable": true, "position": 25, "required": true, "timeZone": null, "attributes": {"srid": null, "dimension": null, "geometry_type": null, "file_max_bytes": null, "file_content_types": null}, "description": null, "enumOptions": null, "defaultValue": null, "relationTarget": "parametro_tributario"}], "actions": {}, "apiOnly": false, "enabled": true, "indexes": [["anio", "predio"], ["anio", "contribuyente"]], "appendOnly": true, "description": "Lo determinado de un servicio, un predio, un uso (secuencia) y un mes, con su desglose. Inmutable: nunca se edita ni se borra (una corrección es una anulación que se agrega). No es deuda: es lo determinado a su fecha_calculo.", "pluralLabel": "Cuotas de arbitrio", "physicalTable": "cuota_arbitrio__00000000", "requiresReason": false, "uniqueConstraints": []}', '2026-10-21 22:36:46.065324+00', NULL, NULL, '9edcdc65-9994-432c-a4e4-f3c341e82165', 'api');
